%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroInspector
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Edwin !
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8365065178d97ef448f3d13cb1c54bb4, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "\xC7a fait longtemps\u202F! Depuis ta reconversion non\u202F?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 1
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Ma foi... Je pr\xE9f\xE9rais m\u2019occuper des archives plut\xF4t que
      de servir le caf\xE9 \xE0 Monsieur. Et toi, comment te portes-tu ?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "\xC0 vrai dire, on ne peut mieux ! Comme tu peux le voir j\u2019ai \xE9t\xE9
      promu."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Et puis, quand j\u2019ai vu d\u2019o\xF9 venait l\u2019appel de ce matin
      au poste, j'ai tout de suite saut\xE9 sur l\u2019occasion !  J\u2019esp\xE8re
      que je pourrais compter sur toi comme \xE0 la bonne \xE9poque ?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Cela ne me d\xE9range pas, il n\u2019y a rien \xE0 faire au manoir actuellement
      mais... "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Tu sais, j\u2019ai encore du mal avec les cadavres et cela s'est assez
      aggrav\xE9\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "De plus, j\u2019aimerais \xE9viter de devoir rendre mon d\xE9jeuner."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Bien s\xFBr, bien s\xFBr. Tu n\u2019auras qu\u2019\xE0 t\u2019occuper
      de mener les diff\xE9rents interrogatoires pendant que j\u2019irais sur place
      pour trouver des indices."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: Merci. Tu as pu obtenir des informations sur la victime ?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: Le nom de la victime est Lawrence Brown, une femme de trente ans qui travaillait
      en tant que journaliste pour The Times.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Elle a \xE9t\xE9 retrouv\xE9e morte dans le bureau du g\xE9rant du manoir.
      Sa mort serait estim\xE9e aux alentours de 19h30. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: 'Quelqu''un a pu contacter sa famille ? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Pas encore mais je peux te donner le num\xE9ro de la demeure familiale.
      Je vais aller examiner la sc\xE8ne du crime pendant ce temps et essayer d\u2019obtenir
      des informations."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21b87153fb3e5f94c809d9a129d0e1ee, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Tu pourrais aussi interroger Monsieur Warner. Si la victime a \xE9t\xE9
      retrouv\xE9e dans son bureau ce n\u2019est pas qu\u2019une co\xEFncidence. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je m\u2019en occupe."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 1
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc66bbd90ed0fa94ebbb4e2dc102bedd, type: 2}
  conditionScene: {fileID: 0}
  conditionToUnlock: 
